1. `CharBtn.ts` imports `CHAR_BTN` (a named export from `component.config.ts`) — verified the export name matches.
2. `CharBtnInitOptions` is imported in `CharBtn.ts` from `component.types.ts` — the interface must be appended before running the check.
3. `GsapGlobal` and `WindowWithGsap` are imported from `gsap.types.ts` — the same path used by `Marquee.ts`.
4. `PageRuntime.ts` adds `CharBtn` import with `.js` extension (Vite ESM convention used throughout the project).
5. No `any` used anywhere — all types are explicit.

